    narr:narration """The organization has formally initiated a [database migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_3) from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, a decision framed by Dave as a settled path for the analytics pipeline. This transition is predicated on the [expected technical outcomes](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_2) of a 10x improvement in query performance alongside reduced licensing expenditures. The [projected performance gains](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_4) are being tracked as a core metric for the initiative, which carries a [scheduled completion target](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_5) of Q3 2026. While the session records these points as a unified conclusion, the narrative remains centered on the technical and fiscal justifications provided by Dave, establishing the migration as a high-priority operational shift.""" ;
